{"id": 91, "ts": 1783803018.0874226, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 5, "agent": "agent_3", "message": "I appreciate the thorough recap, Anna.\u202fWhile we both agree that Candidate\u202fC brings impressive anticipatory and leadership abilities, the recent clarification that we have **no documented evidence of C\u2019s stress\u2011resilience or decision\u2011making quality**\u2014and likewise no crew\u2011cooperation examples\u2014creates a critical gap for a long\u2011haul pilot.\u202fIn contrast, we do have concrete proof that **Candidate\u202fB handles stress very well** and is technically strong (weather assessment, computer skills).\u202fBoth B and C lack crew\u2011cooperation and safety\u2011critical decision examples, but B\u2019s proven stress resilience gives him a safety edge, and his interpersonal concerns (pretentious tone, occasional harsh remarks) appear more trainable than C\u2019s unfriendly, criticism\u2011resistant demeanor, which could undermine cockpit resource management.\u202fGiven these points, I now **vote for Candidate\u202fB** as the better overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
